      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR IMAGE (8) makes his debut without a trial but profiles well for first outing. Likely to go close here first time out. REIGN PLANE (4) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 3rd on November 6 over 520m at Richmond behind Absconding beaten 4.5 lengths (29.89) in a NG. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Can feature again. ELLIDY (1) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish one length away in second (30.12) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5 over 520m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature again. KICK ON COWBOY (7) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
